
~ title

Bandits

=>


~ start

As you walk through a particularly overgrown patch of brush, several armed men emerge from the undergrowth, surrounding you.
	[br][br][wait=1] You have been ambushed by bandits!

- Fight
	You fight the bandits.

	%.60
		do Game.player.apply_stat( Character.Stat.HEALTH, -5.0 )
		=> fight_sucess
	%.40
		do Game.player.apply_stat( Character.Stat.HEALTH, -15.0 )
		=> fight_failure
		
- Pursuade
	You attempt to pursuade the [[bandits|harrasers]] that you're not worth the trouble.
	%
		They mutter in contempt, sneering, "Yeah a filthy traveler like you has nothing any way" and they leave you alone.
	%
		"You think you can fool us" 
		do Game.player.apply_stat( Character.Stat.HEALTH, -10.0 )

- Escape
	%.50
		You sucessfully manage to escape, avoiding any potential harm!
	%.50
		You attempt to run away, however they catch up to you and attack!
			[br][br][wait=1] You manage to fend them off, however, you did not remain unscathed."

=> END


~ fight_sucess

You sucessfully defeat them.

=> END

~ fight_failure

They best you.

#- Surrender your belongings
#- Continue fighting

=> END